WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Start with 144 synthetic curve pairs. Explore a screening workflow at a chosen mixture condition.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose a mixture pressure. The same stored curve pool is reused as conditions change.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Set P = 1 and gas-1 feed fraction y = 0.5, then run the query.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The ranking updates for the new condition. Selectivity determines the shortlist.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Inspect another shortlisted pair. The linked plot reveals its two pure-gas isotherms.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Now compare another operating point: P = 0.32, y = 0.16. No new curve data are needed.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Run again. Candidate scores and the shortlist change with the mixture condition.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Inspect the new shortlist before saving it. Each selected pair stays linked to its curves.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Export the computed shortlist as CSV, including pair IDs, scores and the exact query conditions.
